  "adaptations": [
    "Struct/context and internal symbols renamed; Linux logging removed.",
    "USB callback wrappers latch errors; integer polls are bounded.",
    "RFK success masks report actual convergence and exclude out-of-range fallback IQC.",
    "Backup reads checked before destructive RFK; cleanup writes continue after errors.",
    "LCK restores original TXPAUSE and RF_LCK; signed IQK packing uses unsigned shifts.",
    "8821 IQK hardware-ready/TX-failure flags no longer overridden by constants.",
    "8812 OTP1T1R IQK suppresses absent-path polling and measurement; every present path still requires measured ready/fail/convergence."
  ],
